  << /ActualText (The company target is trotting bettors\054 mainly pool betting\056 At that time Legolas was providing in addition to horse racing bets and pool games\054 also several classic betting verticals such as Sportbook\054 Casino\054 Live Casino with no great return in terms of visibility and money\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 487 0 R
