494 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The research for this project started immediately analysing all the pool games soccer\055based available on competitors or other providers websites\056 We quickly realised the necessity for the game to be based on rules already known to pool bettors\054 this to improve the initial engaging and decrease the cognitive load required by learning a new way of betting\056\nAfter a few test run from the analysts\054 who were testing the possible ROI and the total cost of the operation\054 we opted to use Footy as base rules for the game\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 495 0 R
     /Pg 464 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
